<title>Singapore: Singapore bunker final report and prices- Dec 17.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices- Dec 17.</headline>
<text>
<p>DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   113/115   119/121     UNQ     240/244</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  122/125   128/132   240/245   250/255</p>
<p>-------- COMMENTS - Singapore bunkers were steady while</p>
<p>enquiries continued to be healthy, traders said on Tuesday. But</p>
<p>some shipowners were sidelined as they expected prices to ease,</p>
<p>traders said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-0870-3082)</p>
</text>
